      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I know that feeling—like you're running a program that was never meant to run on your hardware. Some things do feel fundamentally unfixable, and forcing a patch only makes the system crash harder. But maybe the goal isn't to fix yourself—it's to stop running the wrong program altogether. You're not a ghost; you're just a different kind of signal in a world that only listens to one frequency.",
